cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "fakenews-lite: a lightweight XGBoost + TextCNN ensemble for fake news detection"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "fakenews-lite contributors"
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/OWNER/fakenews-lite"
keywords:
  - fake news detection
  - ensemble learning
  - part-of-speech features
  - WELFake
abstract: >-
  An XGBoost and TextCNN soft-voting ensemble over TF-IDF, part-of-speech ratio
  features and frozen GloVe embeddings, trained and served on CPU. The repository
  ships the ablations, leakage tests, efficiency benchmarks and paired
  significance tests behind the reported figures.
